  "experiment": "Session-only VAE decode study: BF16 weights, channels_last layout and a zero-copy restride of the T=1 upsample input, measured standalone and inside the INT8 ComfyUI sampler harness",
  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "production_modified": false,
  "deployed": false,
  "numerics": "fp32-clfix changes the layout only (max 1 level vs FP32 after round-to-nearest conversion, as does a 20-thread FP32 decode); bf16 and bf16-clfix change precision and are not bitwise equal to the FP32 VAE. No quality-equivalence claim is made.",
